    "_weight_rationale": "4-block derived: (B − avg(M,S,C)) / 2. B=11/13, M=−6/6, S=−11/15, C=−2/8. 4 SETUP defers (trait-defs, macros, interface-defs, type-methods).",

    // ===================================================================
